  "paper_id": "ccs-2024-powerpeeler-a-precise-and-general-dynamic-deobfuscation-9615e4a4",
  "title": "PowerPeeler: A Precise and General Dynamic Deobfuscation Method for PowerShell Scripts",
  "abstract": "PowerShell is a powerful and versatile task automation tool. Unfortunately, it is also widely abused by cyber attackers. To bypass malware detection and hinder threat analysis, attackers often employ diverse techniques to obfuscate malicious PowerShell scripts. Existing deobfuscation tools suffer from the limitation of static analysis, which fails to simulate the real deobfuscation process accurately. Accurate, complete, and robust PowerShell script deobfuscation is still a challenging problem.",
